      "writtenOn": "2026-06-11T21:11:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Stores only `LastState`\ncallers use if (this.bootProgress) which is true for `\"None\"` and pre-reboot `\"OSRunning\"`, so completion can fire on the first poll while BMC is still up.\n\nSuggest storing `{ PowerState, BootProgress }` and gating completion on stable state: `PowerState \u003d\u003d\u003d \u0027On\u0027` and `LastState in (\u0027None\u0027, \u0027OSRunning\u0027)`, with a minimum wait after BMC becomes reachable again (BMCs often report On + None before boot firmware updates progress).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 154,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 155,
        "endChar": 50
      },
      "revId": "6a998fd1af0a5b41a644ae4dfb8672b8804e5f05",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
