        "id": 1001955
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-14T12:36:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since its a BMC Reboot , I mostly only care about whether the BMC is up or not, if its not up the LastState will be null , as soon as it has some value BMC is up, moreover powerState and BootProgress tells about chassis and OS state respectively \nwhich is irrelevant to BMC reboot, the OS could be \u0027quiesced\u0027, \u0027inprogress\u0027 or \u0027OSRunning\u0027 post BMC reboot, which again is not a concern here",
      "parentUuid": "17415db4_dd4a0317",
